    "title": "Governor issues state disaster proclamation for 15 counties impacted by severe weather - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago SPRINGFIELD — Gov. J.B. Pritzker on Tuesday, Aug. 18, issued a state disaster proclamation for 15 counties in Illinois — including Ford County — impacted by torrential downpours, flash flooding, straight-line winds and tornadoes in recent weeks. The governor’s proclamation makes additional state resources and personnel available... Read full article",
